#: src/Admin/Page.php:98
msgid ""
"Archive verified means the stored files passed checksum checks. Before a "
"restore replaces live data, its database contents are also compared with the "
"recorded source values. A successful restore rehearsal is a separate check."
msgstr ""
"Archive verified means the stored files passed checksum checks. Before a "
"restore replaces live data, its database contents are also compared with the "
"recorded source values. A successful restore rehearsal is a separate check."

#: src/Admin/Page.php:116
msgid "Restore replaces live site data."
msgstr "Restore replaces live site data."

#: src/Admin/Page.php:117
msgid ""
"Full-site backups can be restored on the original site or migrated to "
"another single-site WordPress installation. If the site URL or table prefix "
"differs, Backups prepares a migration and updates the database for the "
"destination before replacing live data. Multisite migration is not "
"supported. Core Blueprint Base and Backups remain at their currently "
"installed versions during recovery."
msgstr ""
"Les sauvegardes complètes du site peuvent être restaurées sur le site "
"d’origine ou migrées vers une autre installation WordPress monosite. Si "
"l’URL du site ou le préfixe des tables diffère, Backups prépare une "
"migration et adapte la base de données à la destination avant de remplacer "
"les données en production. La migration multisite n’est pas prise en charge. "
"Core Blueprint Base et Backups conservent leurs versions actuellement "
"installées pendant la récupération."

